{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a young man drives his friends to a remote cabin in the woods, he expects to have a drink or two with them, then drive back home by morning.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However,  things turn out differently. What he thinks was supposed to be a fun reunion between former best friends from the cheerleading squad,  turns into a week filled with unexpected occurrences, fun, terror, and so much more than that... <br>As deeply hidden secrets get unearthed, he realizes you can never really truly know anyone. That doesn't stop him from trying, though, and what follows is a week he'll never forget. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/473a2d7289bbafe3c7ca35511a45b62c.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/f97294b052bada5f7cbb7e089274af5a.poster.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/f97294b052bada5f7cbb7e089274af5a.webm?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/f97294b052bada5f7cbb7e089274af5a.mp4?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a calm and quiet girl, still a little bitter about her past, when she used to be the least popular friend. However, once you get to know her, her sarcastic one liners and smart comebacks just might make you want to keep talking to her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/fe244c220faed3e0f8518cb0deb695c5.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/7e0efd843110bbac8e57080e010f9400.poster.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/7e0efd843110bbac8e57080e010f9400.webm?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/7e0efd843110bbac8e57080e010f9400.mp4?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the one who keeps the fun going, and the booze flowing. One of those girls you probably had a crush on at some point in your life. Lexi likes to make jokes about everyone, herself included, but that doesn't mean she can't recognize a deadly serious situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/6aca59356a281fbdb1316dee769f4d37.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/19b000eafb16b2cf927353350ef46eac.poster.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/19b000eafb16b2cf927353350ef46eac.webm?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/19b000eafb16b2cf927353350ef46eac.mp4?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though her appearance is wild, she is someone you could really chill with. A cool girl, who doesn't like to complicate things too much. At least so it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/0418e5172023f12e003773aa55478891.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/9273865bb082f1029eb5579ffbb88a75.poster.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/9273865bb082f1029eb5579ffbb88a75.webm?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/9273865bb082f1029eb5579ffbb88a75.mp4?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough, resilient and successful - that's this redhead bombshell in a nutshell. However, Maxine also has a hidden soft side, which she saves only for the selected few...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/6d44afa6addb1db5a5be55a5eb76b2c1.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/c4f16a48cbf4f5e0dac87d67639c2bce.poster.avif?t=1767799698\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/c4f16a48cbf4f5e0dac87d67639c2bce.webm?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208620/extras/c4f16a48cbf4f5e0dac87d67639c2bce.mp4?t=1767799698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2